      <div class="src-ref"><span>Impact : Multi-projets sans piège</span><span><code>studio.html:593 · HubPage.py:19,35 · HubEdit.py:26</code></span></div>
    </article>

    <!-- P0.3 -->
    <article class="fix-card" data-prio="p0">
      <div class="fix-top">
        <span class="pill p0">P0 · Critique (&lt; 25 min)</span>
        <span class="fix-meta">Priorité #3</span>
